<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Callaway Golf raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Callaway Golf raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch on Wednesday raised its rating for Callaway Golf Co to near-term buy from near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch also named the company its focus stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1-1/4 to 33 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
